        <p class="lead mt-6">After the result come treatment, counselling and follow-up. We run awareness and counselling programmes, mostly on behalf of the government, and help set up patient support groups.</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-moss">Sample collection, transport, testing, reporting, treatment with counselling, follow-up: our testing model covers all six, so that a result leads somewhere.</p>
        <a class="link mt-4" href="/programmes/">See our programmes
